t sizes throughout the game, including:Scripture textTutorial instructionsText on the in-game computer screenYou shouldn't have to sit with your face practically pressed against your monitor just to read scripture! The text is now bigger, clearer, and easier to read.Gettin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T02:43:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034781","verified_at":"2026-10-23T04:13:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4965650-1846651706685373","game_id":"steam-4965650","kind":"announcement","title":"The Canon Keeper Now Supports Controllers! Steam Next Fest Is Here!","summary":"Controller Support Is Here! Steam Next Fest and November 4th Launch!We've been hard at work on The Canon Keeper, and I'm excited to share some big news!Controller support is now available!You can now play The Canon Keeper with a controller! Whether you prefer a mouse and keyboard or a controller, you can experience the game your way.Steam Next Fest Is Here!The Canon Keeper is participating in Steam Next Fest, October 19 through October 26!If you haven't played the demo yet, now is a great time t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T19:10:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685373","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4965650-1845383656390139","game_id":"steam-4965650","kind":"announcement","title":"The Canon Keeper Is Getting Closer to Launch","summary":"We’ve been hard at work on The Canon Keeper as we get closer to release.The game has now been localized into six different languages, making it accessible to even more players around the world. We’ve also been fixing a number of smaller bugs, polishing the experience, and continuing to improve the game based on what we’re seeing from the demo.Between now and launch, we’ll keep fixing bugs, watching player feedback, and making sure the final version is as solid as possible.We’re incredibly excite","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T22:47:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390139","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4965650-1841579228675793","game_id":"steam-4965650","kind":"announcement","title":"The Canon Keeper Demo Has Been Updated","summary":"Over the past month, I’ve gotten a ton of feedback from people playing The Canon Keeper, and I’ve been working through that feedback to make the demo better.A lot has changed.Slower Time While PrayingOne of the biggest pieces of feedback was that there wasn’t enough time to actually stop and read the Scripture before making a decision.Now, when you use the Pray mechanic, time slows down significantly.This gives you a chance to actually read, investigate, think about what you’re looking at, and m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T15:05:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228675793","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4965650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:38Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4965650":"2026-10-26T05:52:38Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4965650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4999790":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:52:38Z","status":"ok","er